    "hypothesis": "Diagonal ordering of sparse blocked cells makes predecessor scans contiguous and the total-distance factorial index increase monotonically, while avoiding an N×N blocked grid. For denser obstacle sets, a one-row DP over obstacle-free runs avoids both the blocked grid and per-cell obstacle checks.",
